/E (This security report details the findings, technical methodology, and compliance impacts from an unauthenticated penetration test against the TryHackMe "Ignite" target environment \(10.49.186.217\). The assessment demonstrated a total compromise of system confidentiality, integrity, and availability, resulting in root-level administrative access over the operating system. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
136 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 83 0 R
/E (The primary objective was to evaluate the exposure of the perimeter web infrastructure and assess the downstream impact of internal configuration weaknesses. The initial entry vector exploited CVE-2018-16763, a critical Remote Code Execution \(RCE\) flaw in Fuel CMS version 1.4. Full system administrative takeover was subsequently achieved through hardcoded cleartext database credentials and permissive local execution policies. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
